{"id":"n15197-2-7","stage":2,"title":"엉터리 · 草包","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15197-2-7-1","ko":"주사를 맞았는데도 왜 병이 안 낫는지 모르겠어.","zh":"我都打过针了，还是不明白为什么病还没好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주사를","meaning":"注射","explanation":"주사：注射；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"주사","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91770","senseId":"1","lemma":"주사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주사를","audio":"/audio/1bc7c2bb9f62db7b7827.mp3"}},{"text":"맞았는데도","meaning":"打针","explanation":"맞다：打针；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"2","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞았는데도","audio":"/audio/562271a8c89560f0fc88.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"병이","meaning":"病","explanation":"병：病；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"병","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62694","senseId":"1","lemma":"병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병이","audio":"/audio/a81bed9b7e2b3ba668bc.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"낫는지","meaning":"痊愈","explanation":"낫다：痊愈；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"낫다","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62354","senseId":"1","lemma":"낫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낫는지","audio":"/audio/91050cd7d557cbe4cc61.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"32b004ef02722e1b","term":"주사","zh":"注射","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3","entryId":"91770","definition":"用注射器直接往人或动物体内注射药液。","pronunciation":["주ː사"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"打针","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66233","definition":"接受在身上扎针、注射等的治疗。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"31eaf1068c99d7f1","term":"병","zh":"病","audio":"/audio/31eaf1068c99d7f1add7.mp3","entryId":"62694","definition":"生物体的身体发生异常，导致生物体无法进行正常活动并感到难受的现象。","pronunciation":["병ː"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"fde5eb6648ee9db9","term":"낫다","zh":"痊愈","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3","entryId":"62354","definition":"疾病或伤口等消失而恢复原样。","pronunciation":["낟ː따"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b8bd3ccd9e77692ba1e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15197-2-7-2","ko":"그 의사 엉터리인 거 아니야?","zh":"那个医生该不会是个半吊子吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"의사","meaning":"医生","explanation":"의사：医生。","readings":[{"term":"의사","audio":"/audio/9b6834dbb2bfc221d4ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20256","senseId":"1","lemma":"의사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의사","audio":"/audio/9b6834dbb2bfc221d4ef.mp3"}},{"text":"엉터리인","meaning":"草包，半吊子，绣花枕头烂稻草","explanation":"엉터리：草包，半吊子，绣花枕头烂稻草；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"엉터리","audio":"/audio/1c6a393976815f8f4d30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15197","senseId":"2","lemma":"엉터리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엉터리인","audio":"/audio/2c921a29d8cbc78a5bac.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"아니야?","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"9b6834dbb2bfc221","term":"의사","zh":"医生","audio":"/audio/9b6834dbb2bfc221d4ef.mp3","entryId":"20256","definition":"具有一定资格、以诊断治疗病症为业的人。","pronunciation":["의사"]},{"id":"1c6a393976815f8f","term":"엉터리","zh":"草包，半吊子，绣花枕头烂稻草","audio":"/audio/1c6a393976815f8f4d30.mp3","entryId":"15197","definition":"外面看起来那样，实际上没有任何用处的东西；或指那样的人或事物。","pronunciation":["엉터리"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","ent